## What is upstream content

Everything under `skills/` is copied verbatim from the upstream repository by
`scripts/sync-skills.mjs`. Upstream prose is not edited, translated, or
reordered here. `upstream.json` records the exact version, commit, file list,
and content digest of every vendored skill.

## What this port adds

`cordis.patch.yml`, `package.json`, `scripts/`, `locale/`, `icon.svg`,
`README.md`, and this file are the port itself and are offered under the same
MIT terms.

## What was left out

`agents/` directories hold another harness's metadata and are not vendored, as
are the upstream `.claude-plugin/`, `.agents/`, `.changeset/`, `docs/`,
`scripts/`, and non-promoted skill buckets (`misc/`, `in-progress/`,
`deprecated/`).
